<section><h2 id="legacy-assertion-mode">Legacy assertion mode<a id="assert_legacy_assertion_mode"></a></h2><div class="api_metadata"></div><p>Legacy assertion mode uses the <a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Operators/Equality"><code>==</code> operator</a> in:</p><ul>
<li><a href="#assertdeepequalactual-expected-message"><code>assert.deepEqual()</code></a></li>
