<ul>
<li><code>level</code> (<a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/docs/Web/JavaScript/Data_structures#string_type">string</a>): Either <code>'info'</code> or <code>'warning'</code>. <strong>Default:</strong> <code>'info'</code>.</li>
<li><code>detail</code> (<a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/docs/Web/JavaScript/Data_structures#Data_types">any</a>): Additional structured-cloneable diagnostic data. With CLI
process isolation, it must also be supported by advanced child process
serialization.</li>
