<section><h3 id="static-method-bufferfromobject-offsetorencoding-length">Static method: <code>Buffer.from(object[, offsetOrEncoding[, length]])</code><a id="buffer_static_method_buffer_from_object_offsetorencoding_length"></a></h3><div class="api_metadata">Added in: v8.2.0</div><ul>
