<section><h3 id="static-method-bufferfromstring-encoding">Static method: <code>Buffer.from(string[, encoding])</code><a id="buffer_static_method_buffer_from_string_encoding"></a></h3><div class="api_metadata">Added in: v5.10.0</div><ul>
