<section><h3 id="static-method-bufferisbufferobj">Static method: <code>Buffer.isBuffer(obj)</code><a id="buffer_static_method_buffer_isbuffer_obj"></a></h3><div class="api_metadata">Added in: v0.1.101</div><ul>
