<section><h3 id="bufferpoolsize"><code>Buffer.poolSize</code><a id="buffer_buffer_poolsize"></a></h3><div class="api_metadata">Added in: v0.11.3<div class="changelog"><p class="histlabel">History</p><table><thead><tr><th>Version</th><th>Changes</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>v26.3.0</td><td><p>Default raised from 8192 to 65536.</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><ul>
