<section><h3 id="bufequalsotherbuffer"><code>buf.equals(otherBuffer)</code><a id="buffer_buf_equals_otherbuffer"></a></h3><div class="api_metadata">Added in: v0.11.13<div class="changelog"><p class="histlabel">History</p><table><thead><tr><th>Version</th><th>Changes</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>v8.0.0</td><td><p>The arguments can now be <code>Uint8Array</code>s.</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><ul>
<li><code>otherBuffer</code> (<a href="#buffer--class-buffer">Buffer</a> or <a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/Uint8Array">Uint8Array</a>): A <code>Buffer</code> or <a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/Uint8Array">Uint8Array</a> with which to
compare <code>buf</code>.</li>
<li>Returns: <a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/docs/Web/JavaScript/Data_structures#boolean_type">boolean</a></li>
</ul><p>Returns <code>true</code> if both <code>buf</code> and <code>otherBuffer</code> have exactly the same bytes,
