<section><h4 id="bufferconstantsmax_length"><code>buffer.constants.MAX_LENGTH</code><a id="buffer_buffer_constants_max_length"></a></h4><div class="api_metadata">Added in: v8.2.0<div class="changelog"><p class="histlabel">History</p><table><thead><tr><th>Version</th><th>Changes</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>v22.0.0</td><td><p>Value is changed to 2<sup>53</sup> - 1 on 64-bit architectures, and 2<sup>31</sup> - 1 on 32-bit architectures.</p></td></tr><tr><td>v15.0.0</td><td><p>Value is changed to 2<sup>32</sup> on 64-bit architectures.</p></td></tr><tr><td>v14.0.0</td><td><p>Value is changed from 2<sup>31</sup> - 1 to 2<sup>32</sup> - 1 on 64-bit architectures.</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><ul>
