<section><h4 id="napi_create_int64"><code>napi_create_int64</code><a id="n_api_napi_create_int64"></a></h4><div class="api_metadata">Added in: v8.4.0<b>N-API Version: </b>1</div><div class="codeblock"><p class="codelabel">Code example:</p><pre><code>napi_status napi_create_int64(napi_env env, int64_t value, napi_value* result)</code></pre><p class="codeend">End of code.</p></div><ul>
