<a href="#napi_create_reference"><code>napi_create_reference</code></a>, which can be used to guarantee control over the
lifetime of the <code>ArrayBuffer</code> or <code>SharedArrayBuffer</code>. It's also safe to use the returned data buffer
within the same callback as long as there are no calls to other APIs that might
trigger a GC.</p></section>
