<section><h4 id="napi_object_freeze"><code>napi_object_freeze</code><a id="n_api_napi_object_freeze"></a></h4><div class="api_metadata">Added in: v14.14.0, v12.20.0<b>N-API Version: </b>8</div><div class="codeblock"><p class="codelabel">Code example:</p><pre><code>napi_status napi_object_freeze(napi_env env,
