<a href="#default-windows-shell">Default Windows shell</a>. <strong>Default:</strong> <code>false</code> (no shell).</li>
<li><code>windowsVerbatimArguments</code> (<a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/docs/Web/JavaScript/Data_structures#boolean_type">boolean</a>): No quoting or escaping of arguments is
