<section><h3 id="subprocessstdin"><code>subprocess.stdin</code><a id="child_process_subprocess_stdin"></a></h3><div class="api_metadata">Added in: v0.1.90</div><ul>
<li>Type: <a href="#class-streamwritable">stream.Writable</a> or <a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/docs/Web/JavaScript/Data_structures#null_type">null</a> or <a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/docs/Web/JavaScript/Data_structures#undefined_type">undefined</a></li>
