<section><h3 id="consoledirobj-options"><code>console.dir(obj[, options])</code><a id="console_console_dir_obj_options"></a></h3><div class="api_metadata">Added in: v0.1.101</div><ul>
<li><code>obj</code> (<a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/docs/Web/JavaScript/Data_structures#Data_types">any</a>)</li>
<li><code>options</code> (<a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/Object">Object</a>)
<ul>
<li><code>showHidden</code> (<a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/docs/Web/JavaScript/Data_structures#boolean_type">boolean</a>): If <code>true</code> then the object's non-enumerable and symbol
properties will be shown too. <strong>Default:</strong> <code>false</code>.</li>
<li><code>depth</code> (<a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/docs/Web/JavaScript/Data_structures#number_type">number</a>): Tells <a href="#utilinspectobject-options"><code>util.inspect()</code></a> how many times to recurse while
