<section><h3 id="x509checkemailemail-options"><code>x509.checkEmail(email[, options])</code><a id="crypto_x509_checkemail_email_options"></a></h3><div class="api_metadata">Added in: v15.6.0<div class="changelog"><p class="histlabel">History</p><table><thead><tr><th>Version</th><th>Changes</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>v18.0.0</td><td><p>The subject option now defaults to <code>'default'</code>.</p></td></tr><tr><td>v17.5.0, v16.14.1</td><td><p>The <code>wildcards</code>, <code>partialWildcards</code>, <code>multiLabelWildcards</code>, and <code>singleLabelSubdomains</code> options have been removed since they had no effect.</p></td></tr><tr><td>v17.5.0, v16.15.0</td><td><p>The subject option can now be set to <code>'default'</code>.</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><ul>
