</li>
<li>Returns: <a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/docs/Web/JavaScript/Data_structures#string_type">string</a> or <a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/docs/Web/JavaScript/Data_structures#undefined_type">undefined</a>. Returns <code>email</code> if the certificate matches,
<code>undefined</code> if it does not.</li>
