<section><h3 id="x509checkissuedothercert"><code>x509.checkIssued(otherCert)</code><a id="crypto_x509_checkissued_othercert"></a></h3><div class="api_metadata">Added in: v15.6.0</div><ul>
<li><code>otherCert</code> (<a href="#class-x509certificate">X509Certificate</a>)</li>
