<section><h3 id="x509subjectaltname"><code>x509.subjectAltName</code><a id="crypto_x509_subjectaltname"></a></h3><div class="api_metadata">Added in: v15.6.0<div class="changelog"><p class="histlabel">History</p><table><thead><tr><th>Version</th><th>Changes</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>v17.3.1, v16.13.2</td><td><p>Parts of this string may be encoded as JSON string literals in response to CVE-2021-44532.</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><ul>
