<ul>
<li><code>key</code> (<a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/docs/Web/JavaScript/Data_structures#string_type">string</a> or <a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/ArrayBuffer">ArrayBuffer</a> or <a href="#buffer--class-buffer">Buffer</a> or <a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/TypedArray">TypedArray</a> or <a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/DataView">DataView</a> or <a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/Object">Object</a> or <a href="#the-whatwg-url-api">URL</a>): The key
