or <code>'raw-seed'</code>. <strong>Default:</strong> <code>'pem'</code>.</li>
<li><code>type</code> (<a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/docs/Web/JavaScript/Data_structures#string_type">string</a>): Must be <code>'pkcs1'</code>, <code>'pkcs8'</code> or <code>'sec1'</code>. This option is
required only if the <code>format</code> is <code>'der'</code> and ignored otherwise.</li>
<li><code>passphrase</code> (<a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/docs/Web/JavaScript/Data_structures#string_type">string</a> or <a href="#buffer--class-buffer">Buffer</a>): The passphrase to use for decryption. When <code>key</code> is a <a href="#the-whatwg-url-api">URL</a>, this is the optional PIN/passphrase forwarded to the
