<section><h3 id="cryptocreatesignalgorithm-options"><code>crypto.createSign(algorithm[, options])</code><a id="crypto_crypto_createsign_algorithm_options"></a></h3><div class="api_metadata">Added in: v0.1.92</div><ul>
