<section><h3 id="cryptodecapsulatekey-ciphertext-callback"><code>crypto.decapsulate(key, ciphertext[, callback])</code><a id="crypto_crypto_decapsulate_key_ciphertext_callback"></a></h3><div class="api_metadata">Added in: v24.7.0</div><ul>
