<li><code>ciphertext</code> (<a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/ArrayBuffer">ArrayBuffer</a> or <a href="#buffer--class-buffer">Buffer</a> or <a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/TypedArray">TypedArray</a> or <a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/DataView">DataView</a>)</li>
