<section><h3 id="cryptodiffiehellmanoptions-callback"><code>crypto.diffieHellman(options[, callback])</code><a id="crypto_crypto_diffiehellman_options_callback"></a></h3><div class="api_metadata">Added in: v13.9.0, v12.17.0<div class="changelog"><p class="histlabel">History</p><table><thead><tr><th>Version</th><th>Changes</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>v26.1.0</td><td><p>Accept key data in addition to KeyObject instances.</p></td></tr><tr><td>v23.11.0</td><td><p>Optional callback argument added.</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><ul>
<li><code>options</code> (<a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/Object">Object</a>)
<ul>
<li><code>privateKey</code> (<a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/Object">Object</a> or <a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/docs/Web/JavaScript/Data_structures#string_type">string</a> or <a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/ArrayBuffer">ArrayBuffer</a> or <a href="#buffer--class-buffer">Buffer</a> or <a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/TypedArray">TypedArray</a> or <a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/DataView">DataView</a> or <a href="#class-keyobject">KeyObject</a> or <a href="#the-whatwg-url-api">URL</a>)</li>
<li><code>publicKey</code> (<a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/Object">Object</a> or <a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/docs/Web/JavaScript/Data_structures#string_type">string</a> or <a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/ArrayBuffer">ArrayBuffer</a> or <a href="#buffer--class-buffer">Buffer</a> or <a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/TypedArray">TypedArray</a> or <a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/DataView">DataView</a> or <a href="#class-keyobject">KeyObject</a>)</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li><code>callback</code> (<a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/Function">Function</a>)
<ul>
<li><code>err</code> (<a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/Error">Error</a>)</li>
<li><code>secret</code> (<a href="#buffer--class-buffer">Buffer</a>)</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li>Returns: <a href="#buffer--class-buffer">Buffer</a>. if the <code>callback</code> function is not provided.</li>
</ul><p>Computes the Diffie-Hellman shared secret based on a <code>privateKey</code> and a <code>publicKey</code>.
