<section><h3 id="cryptogetcipherinfonameornid-options"><code>crypto.getCipherInfo(nameOrNid[, options])</code><a id="crypto_crypto_getcipherinfo_nameornid_options"></a></h3><div class="api_metadata">Added in: v15.0.0</div><ul>
<li><code>nameOrNid</code> (<a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/docs/Web/JavaScript/Data_structures#string_type">string</a> or <a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/docs/Web/JavaScript/Data_structures#number_type">number</a>): The name or nid of the cipher to query.</li>
<li><code>options</code> (<a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/Object">Object</a>)
<ul>
<li><code>keyLength</code> (<a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/docs/Web/JavaScript/Data_structures#number_type">number</a>): A test key length.</li>
<li><code>ivLength</code> (<a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/docs/Web/JavaScript/Data_structures#number_type">number</a>): A test IV length.</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li>Returns: <a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/Object">Object</a>
<ul>
<li><code>name</code> (<a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/docs/Web/JavaScript/Data_structures#string_type">string</a>): The name of the cipher</li>
<li><code>nid</code> (<a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/docs/Web/JavaScript/Data_structures#number_type">number</a> or <a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/docs/Web/JavaScript/Data_structures#undefined_type">undefined</a>): The nid of the cipher. This property is <code>undefined</code> if the
