is <code>undefined</code> when <code>mode</code> is <code>'stream'</code>.</li>
<li><code>ivLength</code> (<a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/docs/Web/JavaScript/Data_structures#number_type">number</a> or <a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/docs/Web/JavaScript/Data_structures#undefined_type">undefined</a>): The expected or default initialization vector length in
bytes. This property is <code>undefined</code> if the cipher does not use an initialization
vector.</li>
<li><code>keyLength</code> (<a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/docs/Web/JavaScript/Data_structures#number_type">number</a>): The expected or default key length in bytes.</li>
