maximum permissible value.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p><code>context</code> (<a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/ArrayBuffer">ArrayBuffer</a> or <a href="#buffer--class-buffer">Buffer</a> or <a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/TypedArray">TypedArray</a> or <a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/DataView">DataView</a>): For Ed25519<sup><a href="#crypto--user-content-fn-openssl32" id="user-content-fnref-openssl32-8">3</a></sup>
(using Ed25519ctx from <a href="https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc8032.txt">RFC 8032</a>), Ed448, ML-DSA, and SLH-DSA,
