given expression evaluates to <code>true</code>:</p><div class="codeblock"><p class="codelabel">Code example:</p><pre><code>$ node inspect main.js
< Debugger listening on ws://127.0.0.1:9229/ce24daa8-3816-44d4-b8ab-8273c8a66d35
