<section><h3 id="dep0089-requirenodeassert">DEP0089: <code>require('node:assert')</code><a id="DEP0089"></a></h3><div class="api_metadata"><div class="changelog"><p class="histlabel">History</p><table><thead><tr><th>Version</th><th>Changes</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>v12.8.0</td><td><p>Deprecation revoked.</p></td></tr><tr><td>v9.9.0, v8.13.0</td><td><p>Documentation-only deprecation.</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><p>Type: Deprecation revoked</p><p>Importing assert directly was not recommended as the exposed functions use
