<section><h3 id="dep0102-using-noassert-in-bufferreadwrite-operations">DEP0102: Using <code>noAssert</code> in <code>Buffer#(read|write)</code> operations<a id="DEP0102"></a></h3><div class="api_metadata"><div class="changelog"><p class="histlabel">History</p><table><thead><tr><th>Version</th><th>Changes</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>v10.0.0</td><td><p>End-of-Life.</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><p>Type: End-of-Life</p><p>Using the <code>noAssert</code> argument has no functionality anymore. All input is
