<section><h3 id="dep0104-processenv-string-coercion">DEP0104: <code>process.env</code> string coercion<a id="DEP0104"></a></h3><div class="api_metadata"><div class="changelog"><p class="histlabel">History</p><table><thead><tr><th>Version</th><th>Changes</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>v10.0.0</td><td><p>Documentation-only deprecation with <code>--pending-deprecation</code> support.</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><p>Type: Documentation-only (supports <a href="#--pending-deprecation"><code>--pending-deprecation</code></a>)</p><p>When assigning a non-string property to <a href="#process--processenv"><code>process.env</code></a>, the assigned value is
