<section><h3 id="dep0108-zlibbytesread">DEP0108: <code>zlib.bytesRead</code><a id="DEP0108"></a></h3><div class="api_metadata"><div class="changelog"><p class="histlabel">History</p><table><thead><tr><th>Version</th><th>Changes</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>v23.0.0</td><td><p>End-of-Life.</p></td></tr><tr><td>v11.0.0</td><td><p>Runtime deprecation.</p></td></tr><tr><td>v10.0.0</td><td><p>Documentation-only deprecation.</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><p>Type: End-of-Life</p><p>Deprecated alias for <a href="#zlibbyteswritten"><code>zlib.bytesWritten</code></a>. This original name was chosen
