<section><h3 id="dep0111-processbinding">DEP0111: <code>process.binding()</code><a id="DEP0111"></a></h3><div class="api_metadata"><div class="changelog"><p class="histlabel">History</p><table><thead><tr><th>Version</th><th>Changes</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>v11.12.0</td><td><p>Added support for <code>--pending-deprecation</code>.</p></td></tr><tr><td>v10.9.0</td><td><p>Documentation-only deprecation.</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><p>Type: Documentation-only (supports <a href="#--pending-deprecation"><code>--pending-deprecation</code></a>)</p><p><code>process.binding()</code> is for use by Node.js internal code only.</p><p>While <code>process.binding()</code> has not reached End-of-Life status in general, it is
