<section><h3 id="dep0113-ciphersetauthtag-deciphergetauthtag">DEP0113: <code>Cipher.setAuthTag()</code>, <code>Decipher.getAuthTag()</code><a id="DEP0113"></a></h3><div class="api_metadata"><div class="changelog"><p class="histlabel">History</p><table><thead><tr><th>Version</th><th>Changes</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>v12.0.0</td><td><p>End-of-Life.</p></td></tr><tr><td>v11.0.0</td><td><p>Runtime deprecation.</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><p>Type: End-of-Life</p><p><code>Cipher.setAuthTag()</code> and <code>Decipher.getAuthTag()</code> are no longer available. They
