<section><h3 id="dep0114-crypto_tobuf">DEP0114: <code>crypto._toBuf()</code><a id="DEP0114"></a></h3><div class="api_metadata"><div class="changelog"><p class="histlabel">History</p><table><thead><tr><th>Version</th><th>Changes</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>v12.0.0</td><td><p>End-of-Life.</p></td></tr><tr><td>v11.0.0</td><td><p>Runtime deprecation.</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><p>Type: End-of-Life</p><p>The <code>crypto._toBuf()</code> function was not designed to be used by modules outside
