<section><h3 id="dep0115-cryptoprng-cryptopseudorandombytes-cryptorng">DEP0115: <code>crypto.prng()</code>, <code>crypto.pseudoRandomBytes()</code>, <code>crypto.rng()</code><a id="DEP0115"></a></h3><div class="api_metadata"><div class="changelog"><p class="histlabel">History</p><table><thead><tr><th>Version</th><th>Changes</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>v11.0.0</td><td><p>Documentation-only deprecation with <code>--pending-deprecation</code> support.</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><p>Type: Documentation-only (supports <a href="#--pending-deprecation"><code>--pending-deprecation</code></a>)</p><p>In recent versions of Node.js, there is no difference between
