<section><h3 id="dep0116-legacy-url-api">DEP0116: Legacy URL API<a id="DEP0116"></a></h3><div class="api_metadata"><div class="changelog"><p class="histlabel">History</p><table><thead><tr><th>Version</th><th>Changes</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>v24.0.0</td><td><p>DEP0169 covers also <code>url.format()</code> and <code>url.resolve()</code>.</p></td></tr><tr><td>v19.0.0, v18.13.0</td><td><p>DEP0169 deprecates <code>url.parse()</code> again.</p></td></tr><tr><td>v15.13.0, v14.17.0</td><td><p>Deprecation revoked. Status changed to "Legacy".</p></td></tr><tr><td>v11.0.0</td><td><p>Documentation-only deprecation.</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><p>Type: Deprecation revoked</p><p>The <a href="#legacy-url-api">legacy URL API</a> is deprecated. This includes <a href="#urlformaturlobject"><code>url.format()</code></a>,
