<section><h3 id="dep0117-native-crypto-handles">DEP0117: Native crypto handles<a id="DEP0117"></a></h3><div class="api_metadata"><div class="changelog"><p class="histlabel">History</p><table><thead><tr><th>Version</th><th>Changes</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>v12.0.0</td><td><p>End-of-Life.</p></td></tr><tr><td>v11.0.0</td><td><p>Runtime deprecation.</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><p>Type: End-of-Life</p><p>Previous versions of Node.js exposed handles to internal native objects through
