<section><h3 id="dep0118-dnslookup-support-for-a-falsy-host-name">DEP0118: <code>dns.lookup()</code> support for a falsy host name<a id="DEP0118"></a></h3><div class="api_metadata"><div class="changelog"><p class="histlabel">History</p><table><thead><tr><th>Version</th><th>Changes</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>v25.0.0</td><td><p>End-of-Life.</p></td></tr><tr><td>v11.0.0</td><td><p>Runtime deprecation.</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><p>Type: End-of-Life</p><p>Previous versions of Node.js supported <code>dns.lookup()</code> with a falsy host name
