<section><h3 id="dep0121-net_setsimultaneousaccepts">DEP0121: <code>net._setSimultaneousAccepts()</code><a id="DEP0121"></a></h3><div class="api_metadata"><div class="changelog"><p class="histlabel">History</p><table><thead><tr><th>Version</th><th>Changes</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>v24.0.0</td><td><p>End-of-Life.</p></td></tr><tr><td>v12.0.0</td><td><p>Runtime deprecation.</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><p>Type: End-of-Life</p><p>The undocumented <code>net._setSimultaneousAccepts()</code> function was originally
