<section><h3 id="dep0132-workerterminate-with-callback">DEP0132: <code>worker.terminate()</code> with callback<a id="DEP0132"></a></h3><div class="api_metadata"><div class="changelog"><p class="histlabel">History</p><table><thead><tr><th>Version</th><th>Changes</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>v25.0.0</td><td><p>End-of-Life.</p></td></tr><tr><td>v12.5.0</td><td><p>Runtime deprecation.</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><p>Type: End-of-Life</p><p>Passing a callback to <a href="#workerterminate"><code>worker.terminate()</code></a> is deprecated. Use the returned
