<section><h3 id="dep0133-http-connection">DEP0133: <code>http</code> <code>connection</code><a id="DEP0133"></a></h3><div class="api_metadata"><div class="changelog"><p class="histlabel">History</p><table><thead><tr><th>Version</th><th>Changes</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>v12.12.0</td><td><p>Documentation-only deprecation.</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><p>Type: Documentation-only</p><p>Prefer <a href="#http--responsesocket"><code>response.socket</code></a> over <a href="#http--responseconnection"><code>response.connection</code></a> and
