<section><h3 id="dep0134-process_tickcallback">DEP0134: <code>process._tickCallback</code><a id="DEP0134"></a></h3><div class="api_metadata"><div class="changelog"><p class="histlabel">History</p><table><thead><tr><th>Version</th><th>Changes</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>v12.12.0</td><td><p>Documentation-only deprecation with <code>--pending-deprecation</code> support.</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><p>Type: Documentation-only (supports <a href="#--pending-deprecation"><code>--pending-deprecation</code></a>)</p><p>The <code>process._tickCallback</code> property was never documented as
