<section><h3 id="dep0135-writestreamopen-and-readstreamopen-are-internal">DEP0135: <code>WriteStream.open()</code> and <code>ReadStream.open()</code> are internal<a id="DEP0135"></a></h3><div class="api_metadata"><div class="changelog"><p class="histlabel">History</p><table><thead><tr><th>Version</th><th>Changes</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>v25.0.0</td><td><p>End-of-Life.</p></td></tr><tr><td>v13.0.0</td><td><p>Runtime deprecation.</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><p>Type: End-of-Life</p><p><a href="#class-fswritestream"><code>WriteStream.open()</code></a> and <a href="#class-fsreadstream"><code>ReadStream.open()</code></a> are undocumented internal
