<section><h3 id="dep0162-fswrite-fswritefilesync-coercion-to-string">DEP0162: <code>fs.write()</code>, <code>fs.writeFileSync()</code> coercion to string<a id="DEP0162"></a></h3><div class="api_metadata"><div class="changelog"><p class="histlabel">History</p><table><thead><tr><th>Version</th><th>Changes</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>v19.0.0</td><td><p>End-of-Life.</p></td></tr><tr><td>v18.0.0</td><td><p>Runtime deprecation.</p></td></tr><tr><td>v17.8.0, v16.15.0</td><td><p>Documentation-only deprecation.</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><p>Type: End-of-Life</p><p>Implicit coercion of objects with own <code>toString</code> property, passed as second
parameter in <a href="#fswritefd-buffer-offset-length-position-callback"><code>fs.write()</code></a>, <a href="#fswritefilefile-data-options-callback"><code>fs.writeFile()</code></a>, <a href="#fsappendfilepath-data-options-callback"><code>fs.appendFile()</code></a>,
