<section><h3 id="-trace-atomics-wait">DEP0165: <code>--trace-atomics-wait</code><a id="DEP0165"></a></h3><div class="api_metadata"><div class="changelog"><p class="histlabel">History</p><table><thead><tr><th>Version</th><th>Changes</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>v23.0.0</td><td><p>End-of-Life.</p></td></tr><tr><td>v22.0.0</td><td><p>Runtime deprecation.</p></td></tr><tr><td>v18.8.0, v16.18.0</td><td><p>Documentation-only deprecation.</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><p>Type: End-of-Life</p><p>The <code>--trace-atomics-wait</code> flag has been removed because
