will throw an error (which the <a href="#the-whatwg-url-api">WHATWG URL API</a> also does).</p></section>
<section><h3 id="dep0171-setters-for-httpincomingmessage-headers-and-trailers">DEP0171: Setters for <code>http.IncomingMessage</code> headers and trailers<a id="DEP0171"></a></h3><div class="api_metadata"><div class="changelog"><p class="histlabel">History</p><table><thead><tr><th>Version</th><th>Changes</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>v19.3.0, v18.13.0</td><td><p>Documentation-only deprecation.</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><p>Type: Documentation-only</p><p>In a future version of Node.js, <a href="#messageheaders"><code>message.headers</code></a>,
