<section><h3 id="dep0196-calling-nodechild_process-functions-with-optionsshell-as-an-empty-string">DEP0196: Calling <code>node:child_process</code> functions with <code>options.shell</code> as an empty string<a id="DEP0196"></a></h3><div class="api_metadata"><div class="changelog"><p class="histlabel">History</p><table><thead><tr><th>Version</th><th>Changes</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>v24.2.0, v22.17.0</td><td><p>Documentation-only deprecation.</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><p>Type: Documentation-only</p><p>Calling the process-spawning functions with <code>{ shell: '' }</code> is almost certainly
