<section><h3 id="dep0202-http1incomingmessage-and-http1serverresponse-options-of-http2-servers">DEP0202: <code>Http1IncomingMessage</code> and <code>Http1ServerResponse</code> options of HTTP/2 servers<a id="DEP0202"></a></h3><div class="api_metadata"><div class="changelog"><p class="histlabel">History</p><table><thead><tr><th>Version</th><th>Changes</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>v25.7.0</td><td><p>Documentation-only deprecation.</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><p>Type: Documentation-only</p><p>The <code>Http1IncomingMessage</code> and <code>Http1ServerResponse</code> options of
