<section><h3 id="dep0204-keyobjectfrom-with-non-extractable-cryptokey">DEP0204: <code>KeyObject.from()</code> with non-extractable <code>CryptoKey</code><a id="DEP0204"></a></h3><div class="api_metadata"><div class="changelog"><p class="histlabel">History</p><table><thead><tr><th>Version</th><th>Changes</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>v26.0.0</td><td><p>Runtime deprecation.</p></td></tr><tr><td>v25.9.0</td><td><p>Documentation-only deprecation.</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><p>Type: Runtime</p><p>Passing a non-extractable <a href="#webcrypto--class-cryptokey"><code>CryptoKey</code></a> to <a href="#static-method-keyobjectfromkey"><code>KeyObject.from()</code></a> is
