</ul><p>Remove a message handler previously registered to this channel with
<a href="#channelbindstorestore-transform"><code>channel.bindStore(store)</code></a>.</p><div class="codeblock"><p class="codelabel">ES module version:</p><pre><code>import diagnostics_channel from 'node:diagnostics_channel';
import { AsyncLocalStorage } from 'node:async_hooks';

