<section><h4 id="boundedchannelsubscribehandlers"><code>boundedChannel.subscribe(handlers)</code><a id="diagnostics_channel_boundedchannel_subscribe_handlers"></a></h4><div class="api_metadata">Added in: v26.1.0</div><ul>
