<a href="#utilgetsystemerrornameerr"><code>util.getSystemErrorName(error.errno)</code></a>.</p></section>
<section><h3 id="errorinfo"><code>error.info</code><a id="errors_error_info"></a></h3><div class="api_metadata"></div><ul>
