<section><h3 id="errormessage-1"><code>error.message</code><a id="errors_error_message_1"></a></h3><div class="api_metadata"></div><ul>
<li>Type: <a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/docs/Web/JavaScript/Data_structures#string_type">string</a></li>
