<section><h3 id="err_construct_call_required"><code>ERR_CONSTRUCT_CALL_REQUIRED</code><a id="errors_err_construct_call_required"></a></h3><div class="api_metadata"></div><p>A constructor for a class was called without <code>new</code>.</p><p><a id="ERR_CONTEXT_NOT_INITIALIZED"></a></p></section>
