<section><h3 id="err_out_of_range"><code>ERR_OUT_OF_RANGE</code><a id="errors_err_out_of_range"></a></h3><div class="api_metadata"></div><p>A given value is out of the accepted range.</p><p><a id="ERR_PACKAGE_IMPORT_NOT_DEFINED"></a></p></section>
<section><h3 id="err_package_import_not_defined"><code>ERR_PACKAGE_IMPORT_NOT_DEFINED</code><a id="errors_err_package_import_not_defined"></a></h3><div class="api_metadata"></div><p>The <code>package.json</code> <a href="#imports"><code>"imports"</code></a> field does not define the given internal
