<section><h3 id="emitterlistenercounteventname-listener"><code>emitter.listenerCount(eventName[, listener])</code><a id="events_emitter_listenercount_eventname_listener"></a></h3><div class="api_metadata">Added in: v3.2.0<div class="changelog"><p class="histlabel">History</p><table><thead><tr><th>Version</th><th>Changes</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>v19.8.0, v18.16.0</td><td><p>Added the <code>listener</code> argument.</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><ul>
<li><code>eventName</code> (<a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/docs/Web/JavaScript/Data_structures#string_type">string</a> or <a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/docs/Web/JavaScript/Data_structures#symbol_type">symbol</a>): The name of the event being listened for</li>
<li><code>listener</code> (<a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/Function">Function</a>): The event handler function</li>
