<section><h3 id="emitterlistenerseventname"><code>emitter.listeners(eventName)</code><a id="events_emitter_listeners_eventname"></a></h3><div class="api_metadata">Added in: v0.1.26<div class="changelog"><p class="histlabel">History</p><table><thead><tr><th>Version</th><th>Changes</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>v7.0.0</td><td><p>For listeners attached using <code>.once()</code> this returns the original listeners instead of wrapper functions now.</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><ul>
<li><code>eventName</code> (<a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/docs/Web/JavaScript/Data_structures#string_type">string</a> or <a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/docs/Web/JavaScript/Data_structures#symbol_type">symbol</a>)</li>
