or <a href="#class-eventemitter">EventEmitter</a> instances. If none are specified, <code>n</code> is set as the default
max for all newly created <a href="#events--class-eventtarget">EventTarget</a> and <a href="#class-eventemitter">EventEmitter</a> objects.</li>
</ul><div class="codeblock"><p class="codelabel">ES module version:</p><pre><code>import { setMaxListeners, EventEmitter } from 'node:events';

const target = new EventTarget();
const emitter = new EventEmitter();

setMaxListeners(5, target, emitter);</code></pre><p class="codeend">End of code.</p><p class="codelabel">CommonJS version:</p><pre><code>const {
