</ul><p>Dispatches the <code>event</code> to the list of handlers for <code>event.type</code>.</p><p>The registered event listeners is synchronously invoked in the order they
were registered.</p></section>
<section><h4 id="eventtargetremoveeventlistenertype-listener-options"><code>eventTarget.removeEventListener(type, listener[, options])</code><a id="events_eventtarget_removeeventlistener_type_listener_options"></a></h4><div class="api_metadata">Added in: v14.5.0</div><ul>
