<section><h3 id="events--class-customevent">Class: <code>CustomEvent</code><a id="events_class_customevent"></a></h3><div class="api_metadata">Added in: v18.7.0, v16.17.0<div class="changelog"><p class="histlabel">History</p><table><thead><tr><th>Version</th><th>Changes</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>v23.0.0</td><td><p>No longer experimental.</p></td></tr><tr><td>v22.1.0, v20.13.0</td><td><p>CustomEvent is now stable.</p></td></tr><tr><td>v19.0.0</td><td><p>No longer behind <code>--experimental-global-customevent</code> CLI flag.</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><ul>
