<section><h4 id="filehandlewritestring-position-encoding"><code>filehandle.write(string[, position[, encoding]])</code><a id="fs_filehandle_write_string_position_encoding"></a></h4><div class="api_metadata">Added in: v10.0.0<div class="changelog"><p class="histlabel">History</p><table><thead><tr><th>Version</th><th>Changes</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>v14.0.0</td><td><p>The <code>string</code> parameter won't coerce unsupported input to strings anymore.</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><ul>
