<section><h4 id="filehandlewritefiledata-options"><code>filehandle.writeFile(data, options)</code><a id="fs_filehandle_writefile_data_options"></a></h4><div class="api_metadata">Added in: v10.0.0<div class="changelog"><p class="histlabel">History</p><table><thead><tr><th>Version</th><th>Changes</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>v15.14.0, v14.18.0</td><td><p>The <code>data</code> argument supports <code>AsyncIterable</code>, <code>Iterable</code>, and <code>Stream</code>.</p></td></tr><tr><td>v14.0.0</td><td><p>The <code>data</code> parameter won't coerce unsupported input to strings anymore.</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><ul>
