<section><h3 id="fspromiseslinkexistingpath-newpath"><code>fsPromises.link(existingPath, newPath)</code><a id="fs_fspromises_link_existingpath_newpath"></a></h3><div class="api_metadata">Added in: v10.0.0</div><ul>
