<section><h3 id="fspromiseslstatpath-options"><code>fsPromises.lstat(path[, options])</code><a id="fs_fspromises_lstat_path_options"></a></h3><div class="api_metadata">Added in: v10.0.0<div class="changelog"><p class="histlabel">History</p><table><thead><tr><th>Version</th><th>Changes</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>v26.8.0</td><td><p>Accepts an additional <code>signal</code> option to allow aborting the operation.</p></td></tr><tr><td>v10.5.0</td><td><p>Accepts an additional <code>options</code> object to specify whether the numeric values returned should be bigint.</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><ul>
<li><code>path</code> (<a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/docs/Web/JavaScript/Data_structures#string_type">string</a> or <a href="#buffer--class-buffer">Buffer</a> or <a href="#the-whatwg-url-api">URL</a>)</li>
<li><code>options</code> (<a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/Object">Object</a>)
<ul>
<li><code>bigint</code> (<a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/docs/Web/JavaScript/Data_structures#boolean_type">boolean</a>): Whether the numeric values in the returned
<a href="#class-fsstats">fs.Stats</a> object should be <code>bigint</code>. <strong>Default:</strong> <code>false</code>.</li>
<li><code>signal</code> (<a href="#class-abortsignal">AbortSignal</a>): An AbortSignal to cancel the operation. <strong>Default:</strong> <code>undefined</code>.</li>
