is also required.</p><p>Like <a href="#class-fsreadstream">fs.ReadStream</a>, if <code>fd</code> is specified, <a href="#class-fswritestream">fs.WriteStream</a> will ignore the <code>path</code> argument and will use the specified file descriptor. This means that no
<code>'open'</code> event will be emitted. <code>fd</code> should be blocking; non-blocking <code>fd</code>s
