<section><h3 id="fslutimespath-atime-mtime-callback"><code>fs.lutimes(path, atime, mtime, callback)</code><a id="fs_fs_lutimes_path_atime_mtime_callback"></a></h3><div class="api_metadata">Added in: v14.5.0, v12.19.0<div class="changelog"><p class="histlabel">History</p><table><thead><tr><th>Version</th><th>Changes</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>v18.0.0</td><td><p>Passing an invalid callback to the <code>callback</code> argument now throws <code>ERR_INVALID_ARG_TYPE</code> instead of <code>ERR_INVALID_CALLBACK</code>.</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><ul>
<li><code>path</code> (<a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/docs/Web/JavaScript/Data_structures#string_type">string</a> or <a href="#buffer--class-buffer">Buffer</a> or <a href="#the-whatwg-url-api">URL</a>)</li>
<li><code>atime</code> (<a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/docs/Web/JavaScript/Data_structures#number_type">number</a> or <a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/docs/Web/JavaScript/Data_structures#string_type">string</a> or <a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/Date">Date</a>)</li>
<li><code>mtime</code> (<a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/docs/Web/JavaScript/Data_structures#number_type">number</a> or <a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/docs/Web/JavaScript/Data_structures#string_type">string</a> or <a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/Date">Date</a>)</li>
<li><code>callback</code> (<a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/Function">Function</a>)
<ul>
<li><code>err</code> (<a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/Error">Error</a>)</li>
