<section><h3 id="fsfstatsyncfd-options"><code>fs.fstatSync(fd[, options])</code><a id="fs_fs_fstatsync_fd_options"></a></h3><div class="api_metadata">Added in: v0.1.95<div class="changelog"><p class="histlabel">History</p><table><thead><tr><th>Version</th><th>Changes</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>v10.5.0</td><td><p>Accepts an additional <code>options</code> object to specify whether the numeric values returned should be bigint.</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><ul>
