<section><h3 id="fslutimessyncpath-atime-mtime"><code>fs.lutimesSync(path, atime, mtime)</code><a id="fs_fs_lutimessync_path_atime_mtime"></a></h3><div class="api_metadata">Added in: v14.5.0, v12.19.0</div><ul>
