<section><h3 id="fsmkdtempdisposablesyncprefix-options"><code>fs.mkdtempDisposableSync(prefix[, options])</code><a id="fs_fs_mkdtempdisposablesync_prefix_options"></a></h3><div class="api_metadata">Added in: v24.4.0</div><ul>
