<li><code>options</code> (<a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/docs/Web/JavaScript/Data_structures#string_type">string</a> or <a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/Object">Object</a>)
<ul>
<li><code>encoding</code> (<a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/docs/Web/JavaScript/Data_structures#string_type">string</a>): <strong>Default:</strong> <code>'utf8'</code></li>
</ul>
</li>
<li>Returns: <a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/Object">Object</a>. A disposable object:
<ul>
<li><code>path</code> (<a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/docs/Web/JavaScript/Data_structures#string_type">string</a> or <a href="#buffer--class-buffer">Buffer</a>): The path of the created directory.</li>
