<li><code>options</code> (<a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/Object">Object</a> or <a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/docs/Web/JavaScript/Data_structures#string_type">string</a>)
<ul>
<li><code>encoding</code> (<a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/docs/Web/JavaScript/Data_structures#string_type">string</a> or <a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/docs/Web/JavaScript/Data_structures#null_type">null</a>): <strong>Default:</strong> <code>'utf8'</code></li>
