</ul><p>For detailed information, see the documentation of the asynchronous version of
this API: <a href="#fswritefd-string-position-encoding-callback"><code>fs.write(fd, string...)</code></a>.</p></section>
<section><h3 id="fswritevsyncfd-buffers-position"><code>fs.writevSync(fd, buffers[, position])</code><a id="fs_fs_writevsync_fd_buffers_position"></a></h3><div class="api_metadata">Added in: v12.9.0</div><ul>
