<section><h4 id="watcherref-1"><code>watcher.ref()</code><a id="fs_watcher_ref_1"></a></h4><div class="api_metadata">Added in: v14.3.0, v12.20.0</div><ul>
<li>Returns: <a href="#class-fsstatwatcher">fs.StatWatcher</a></li>
