}</code></pre><p class="codeend">End of code.</p></div></section>
<section><h4 id="statfsbavail"><code>statfs.bavail</code><a id="fs_statfs_bavail"></a></h4><div class="api_metadata">Added in: v19.6.0, v18.15.0</div><ul>
