<li>Returns: <a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/Object">Object</a></li>
</ul><p>When <code>definitions</code> is provided, resolves each named symbol and returns an
object containing callable wrappers.</p><p>When <code>definitions</code> is omitted, returns wrappers for all functions that have
already been resolved on the library.</p></section>
<section><h3 id="librarygetsymbolname"><code>library.getSymbol(name)</code><a id="ffi_library_getsymbol_name"></a></h3><div class="api_metadata"></div><ul>
