<section><h3 id="static-method-abortsignalabortreason">Static method: <code>AbortSignal.abort([reason])</code><a id="globals_static_method_abortsignal_abort_reason"></a></h3><div class="api_metadata">Added in: v15.12.0, v14.17.0<div class="changelog"><p class="histlabel">History</p><table><thead><tr><th>Version</th><th>Changes</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>v17.2.0, v16.14.0</td><td><p>Added the new optional reason argument.</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><ul>
