<li>Returns: <a href="#class-abortsignal">AbortSignal</a></li>
</ul><p>Returns a new already aborted <code>AbortSignal</code>.</p></section>
<section><h3 id="static-method-abortsignaltimeoutdelay">Static method: <code>AbortSignal.timeout(delay)</code><a id="globals_static_method_abortsignal_timeout_delay"></a></h3><div class="api_metadata">Added in: v17.3.0, v16.14.0</div><ul>
