<section><h3 id="navigatorhardwareconcurrency"><code>navigator.hardwareConcurrency</code><a id="globals_navigator_hardwareconcurrency"></a></h3><div class="api_metadata">Added in: v21.0.0</div><ul>
<li>Type: <a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/docs/Web/JavaScript/Data_structures#number_type">number</a></li>
</ul><p>The <code>navigator.hardwareConcurrency</code> read-only property returns the number of
