<section><h3 id="requestsettimeouttimeout-callback"><code>request.setTimeout(timeout[, callback])</code><a id="http_request_settimeout_timeout_callback"></a></h3><div class="api_metadata">Added in: v0.5.9<div class="changelog"><p class="histlabel">History</p><table><thead><tr><th>Version</th><th>Changes</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>v9.0.0</td><td><p>Consistently set socket timeout only when the socket connects.</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><ul>
