<section><h3 id="outgoingmessagewritablehighwatermark"><code>outgoingMessage.writableHighWaterMark</code><a id="http_outgoingmessage_writablehighwatermark"></a></h3><div class="api_metadata">Added in: v12.9.0</div><ul>
